    {
      "number": "10",
      "text": "10\uff0e\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\na\uff09$\\frac{5x^2-x}{a^2}\\cdot\\frac{a}{x^2}$\uff1b\nb\uff09$\\frac{a^2b^2}{a^2-9b^2}\\cdot\\frac{a+3b}{2ab}$\uff1b\nc\uff09$\\frac{a-3}{4b^2}:\\frac{4a-12}{b^3}$\uff1b\nd\uff09$\\frac{7x^2y}{x^2-3xy}:\\frac{21x}{x-3y}$\uff0e",
