    {
      "number": "11",
      "text": "11\uff0e\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u7684\u503c\uff1a\na\uff09$\\frac{(a-2)^2}{a^2-5a}\\cdot\\frac{2a-10}{4-a^2}$\uff0c\u5f53 $a=-\\frac13$ \u65f6\uff1b\nb\uff09$\\frac{1-4x^2}{x^2-4x}:\\frac{(2x-1)^2}{x^2-16}$\uff0c\u5f53 $x=-0.25$ \u65f6\uff0e",
